<!--
    The splash mark: the full `buk in.` lockup on the 432dp canvas.

    Sized to fit inside the **288dp visible circle**, not its bounding square. The splash
    icon is circle-masked, and a 3.36:1 lockup scaled to the full 288dp width would have had
    both ends cut off — the same mistake the launcher icon made in the other direction.

    Each half sits in its own group behind a clip rectangle that starts collapsed.
    avd_splash widens them in sequence, so `buk` strokes on and then `in` writes itself.
-->
